<title>INDIA: India Colgate 1996/97 net higher.</title>
<headline>India Colgate 1996/97 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		780.3  vs	775.8</p>
<p>    Net sales	     9,618.9  vs    8,501.1</p>
<p>Note: Colgate-Palmolive (India) Ltd did not release other details for the year ended March 31, 1997. The company said due to its decision to pass onto consumers the full benefit of excise duty reductions announced in the federal budget, it absorbed an amount of approximately 100 million rupees. This impacted the net profit for the year.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91-22-265 9000)</p>
</text>
